      "@type": "ClusterType",
      "@id": "sdc4:mc-r2g662g70dx34eq12v9n4ng7",
      "label": "Vital Statistics Governed Record",
      "description": "Root data cluster (DMType Item) for a governed vital-statistics record in CordovaOS: vital events compiled for statistical use. Wraps the domain's data components with the shared W3C PROV-O Provenance cluster so each record carries its lineage bound alongside its data. Workflow, attestation, parties, and the system audit trail sit in the DMType's native governance slots; access control and retention apply as bound sdcgovernance policy.",
